{"3783850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RELSU", "steam_appid": 3783850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELSU</strong> is a dynamic roguelite game. Team up with up to four friends or fight alone. Repel waves of enemies, battle powerful bosses, complete various quests, and improve your character with a unique skill tree for each one. Experience the thrill of this fast-paced action roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your friends and team up to fight hundreds of monsters, complete random team challenges, and level up. Have fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE RANDOM TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each unique task and battle the Boss at the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each RELSU has unique abilities that match their character style, as well as general abilities that suit all characters. Find the one that fits your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on different game maps. Each one has a unique playing arena, ranging from simple to interesting shapes, with unique textures, designs, and color schemes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY ON DISCORD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter an error, would like to leave other feedback, or just want to find people to talk to, you can do all this and much more on our Discord server! We also plan to publish content from this and our future games. Join us, we are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELSU</strong> is a dynamic roguelite game. Team up with up to four friends or fight alone. Repel waves of enemies, battle powerful bosses, complete various quests, and improve your character with a unique skill tree for each one. Experience the thrill of this fast-paced action roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your friends and team up to fight hundreds of monsters, complete random team challenges, and level up. Have fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/088b4c0cc3f342e758fea82ee1ee6b01.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE RANDOM TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each unique task and battle the Boss at the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/eca4003b6f7ce8290e39457a479923f2.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each RELSU has unique abilities that match their character style, as well as general abilities that suit all characters. Find the one that fits your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/506358a602dca73c1cc8cc8b623e0a32.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on different game maps. Each one has a unique playing arena, ranging from simple to interesting shapes, with unique textures, designs, and color schemes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.poster.avif?t=1782994857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.webm?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/extras/e38e3b802196e3387a69abecc4bbebde.mp4?t=1782994857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY ON DISCORD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter an error, would like to leave other feedback, or just want to find people to talk to, you can do all this and much more on our Discord server! We also plan to publish content from this and our future games. Join us, we are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "RELSU — a fast‑paced roguelite: repel waves of enemies, battle powerful bosses, complete diverse quests, and upgrade your character through a unique skill tree. Play solo or team up with up to 4 players, blending tactics and action in every run.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/058d7d129efd77226160d4d1e6f3c6fc1082908a/header.jpg?t=1782994857", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/ca7edfddfb1b7cee5fd2cfc8084c08c7a7200abd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782994857", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783850/ca7edfddfb1b7cee5fd2cfc8084c08c7a7200abd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782994857", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> (Intel): Core i5-2300 @ 2,80 GHz, (AMD): FX 8120 @ 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> (NVIDIA): GeForce® GT 730, (AMD): Radeon R7 240<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></